  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 multilayer stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Initialize thicknesses from Round 2 best candidate: [108.66, 56.51, 115.65, 58.86, 122.67, 61.23, 130.04, 61.40, 145.56, 62.94, 152.06, 66.95, 130.76, 114.91, 115.44, 130.11, 120.17, 114.78, 52.69, 53.38] nm. Apply asymmetric optimization bounds: high-index layers (indices 0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14,16) ±3 nm from initialization; low-index layers (indices 1,3,5,7,9,11,13,15,17,18,19) ±1.5 nm from initialization. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with dual-band soft objectives: maximize mean transmittance in 1000-1700 nm, maximize mean reflectance in 300-450 nm. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum total layer count of 30.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a 20-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on a fused silica substrate illuminated from air. Initialize layer thicknesses to the provided vector, constrain high-index layers to ±3 nm and low-index layers to ±1.5 nm around initialization. Maximize mean transmittance in 1000–1700 nm and maximize mean reflectance in 300–450 nm at normal incidence with unpolarized light. Total layer count is fixed at 20.",
